# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and fill in. Real credentials go only in .env. Read by config.py.
# Unset or empty DATABASE_URL: the SQLite file registry.db in this directory.
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:////absolute/path/to/registry.db
# PostgreSQL through psycopg 3 (keep "+psycopg"); the agropilot-pg container from the README:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://postgres:<password>@127.0.0.1:5436/registry
# Percent-encode special characters in the password, e.g. @ -> %40, / -> %2F.
# Do not put TEST_DATABASE_URL here; set it in the shell for a test run.
